  --sidebar-border: oklch(0.269 0 0);
  --sidebar-ring: oklch(0.556 0 0);
}
```

### Theming Rules

- ALWAYS use semantic token classes: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `text-primary-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`
- NEVER use raw hex values (`bg-[#fff]`), arbitrary color values, or palette classes (`bg-zinc-900`)
- NEVER hardcode `dark:` overrides on individual elements — theme switching flows through CSS variables
- Adjust the palette by editing CSS variables in `:root`/`.dark`, not by sprinkling colors across components
- Keep `cssVariables: true` in `components.json` — setting it to `false` breaks the semantic token model
- Leave `tailwind.config` blank in `components.json` — there is no JS config to reference in v4

