## 4. shadcn/ui Component Patterns

### Distribution Model

shadcn/ui is a CODE DISTRIBUTION system, not an npm dependency. The CLI copies component source into your project.

- Install components: `npx shadcn@latest add <component-name>`
- NEVER copy-paste components manually or import from a `@shadcn/ui` package
- Components live in `components/ui/` — this directory is owned by the registry workflow
- Use `new-york` style (the `default` style is deprecated)
- Primitives import from the unified `radix-ui` package: `import { Dialog as DialogPrimitive } from "radix-ui"`
- Before re-running `add` on an installed component, preview with `--dry-run` and `--diff`

### CLI v4 Commands (2026)

```bash
npx shadcn@latest init              # Scaffold project, writes components.json
npx shadcn@latest init --base radix # Choose Radix primitives (or --base base-ui)
npx shadcn@latest add <name>        # Install a component
npx shadcn@latest add <name> --dry-run --diff  # Preview changes before install
npx shadcn@latest info              # Show framework, Tailwind version, installed components
npx shadcn@latest info --json       # Machine-readable project context
npx shadcn@latest docs <component>  # Fetch docs, composition trees, and examples
npx shadcn@latest search <query>    # Search available components
npx shadcn@latest skills generate   # Generate machine-readable skills file for AI agents
npx shadcn@latest skills update     # Refresh skills after component changes
npx shadcn@latest migrate radix     # Migrate to unified Radix package
```

### Component Composition

Follow the composition tree — shadcn components have specific parent/child relationships:

```
Card
├── CardHeader
│   ├── CardTitle
│   ├── CardDescription
│   └── CardAction
├── CardContent
└── CardFooter
```

Rules:
- Use `asChild` (Radix) or `render` (Base UI) for custom trigger elements — check `base` field via `npx shadcn@latest info`
- Build feature components in `components/` that import and WRAP primitives from `components/ui/`
- NEVER fork primitives by editing files in `components/ui/` directly — they drift from upstream a11y/security fixes
- Route ALL class merging through the `cn()` helper (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`). Never concatenate class strings manually
- Do NOT strip Radix primitive props, `aria-*` attributes, `data-*` state hooks, or focus/keyboard handlers when wrapping

### Icons

- Pass icons as components: `icon={CheckIcon}`, not string keys
- Use `data-icon` or `data-icon="inline"` on `Button` and similar components
- NEVER add sizing classes (`size-4`, `w-4 h-4`) to icons inside shadcn components — they handle icon sizing via CSS

### Forms

- Validation uses `data-invalid` + `aria-invalid` on inputs
- Use the compound `Form` components: `FormField`, `FormItem`, `FormLabel`, `FormControl`, `FormMessage`
- Integrate with React Hook Form + Zod validation schemas

