## Summary Checklist

Before submitting any UI code, verify:

- [ ] No `tailwind.config.js` — all config in CSS via `@theme`
- [ ] Colors use OKLCH values in `:root` and `.dark`, mapped via `@theme inline` with `--color-` prefix
- [ ] Every token in `:root` has a matching entry in `.dark`
- [ ] Using `tw-animate-css`, not `tailwindcss-animate`
- [ ] Dark mode enabled via `@custom-variant dark (&:is(.dark *))` in CSS
- [ ] Semantic token classes only (`bg-background`, `text-primary`) — no hex/arbitrary/palette values
- [ ] Components installed via `npx shadcn@latest add`, not copied manually
- [ ] Feature components compose around primitives in `components/ui/` — never fork in place
- [ ] All class merging uses the `cn()` helper
- [ ] `focus-visible:` used for keyboard focus indicators
- [ ] `motion-safe:`/`motion-reduce:` used for animations
- [ ] Icon-only buttons have `aria-label` or `sr-only` text
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG 2.2 AA ratios
